# The explorer moved to /muni-spending/ on 2026-11-01. Where the server reads this file, every old
# address, pages and data files alike, gets a permanent redirect to the same place under the new one,
# with its query string. The pages beside it (src/pages/mass-school-spending/) cover servers that don't.
RedirectMatch 301 ^/mass-school-spending/(.*)$ /muni-spending/$1
